# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
#
# When this customer-app dist is merged with staff-app dist at /staff/ and
# sa-harness dist at /setup/ (see scripts/build-pages.sh), CF Pages serves
# THIS file from the merged root. /staff/* must fall back to
# /staff/index.html (the staff SPA shell), /setup/* to /setup/index.html
# (the HQ bootstrap UI), and everything else to /index.html (the customer
# SPA shell). CF Pages evaluates rules in order, first match wins, so the
# more-specific staff / setup rules have to come before the catch-all.
#
# Solo customer-app deploys (no merge) ignore the /staff/* + /setup/* rules
# entirely because CF Pages prefers a static file when one exists at the
# requested path; /staff/foo or /setup/foo with no /staff/ + /setup/ subtree
# just falls through to the next rule and resolves to /index.html.
/staff/*  /staff/index.html  200
/setup/*  /setup/index.html  200
/*        /index.html        200
